{%- comment -%}
  Animate on scroll attributes for a section root (assets/mu-motion.js, loaded by the layout). Output only when Theme
  settings > Animations is on and so is the section's own setting.
  Accepts: on (the section's animate setting), items (selector of what rises in, inside the root; blank: the root
  itself), p (optional selector of elements given a scroll progress, for a zoom or drift).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.motion_level != 'off' and settings.animations and on %} data-mu-motion data-mu-anim="{{ items | escape }}"{% if p != blank %} data-mu-p="{{ p | escape }}"{% endif %}{% endif -%}
